    "id": "claude-loopback-model-input-capture",
    "in_band_mechanism": "unavailable",
    "inject_classification": "Claude cannot disable its own project-memory discovery, so the contract's alternative is used: every injected source is proved absent from the same exact model input, and exactly-once handoff remains the kernel's launcher-controlled generation state.",
